WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:05,520
Please be prepared. I rely on South Korea and North Korea, right? How can this be done?

2
00:00:05,880 --> 00:00:07,280
We can hardly eat now

3
00:00:07,440 --> 00:00:10,840
I still have to deal with Han Chao, but he is a senior

4
00:00:11,120 --> 00:00:12,440
Where should we go to find food?

5
00:00:13,000 --> 00:00:14,680
South Korea and North Korea don’t know how long this will last.

6
00:00:15,000 --> 00:00:20,660
I need to stock up on more food then. I don’t know. We’ll talk about it tomorrow. Let’s rest today.

7
00:00:27,410 --> 00:00:30,690
I don’t know if the herd of cows are still there even after all this time.

8
00:00:30,890 --> 00:00:32,610
Bison ate contaminated grass for so long

9
00:00:32,930 --> 00:00:34,450
It's probably all covered in rotten flesh.

10
00:00:34,770 --> 00:00:35,850
It seems I can only find some tomorrow

11
00:00:35,850 --> 00:00:37,330
The wild fruits and insects of Lingxing

12
00:00:37,570 --> 00:00:39,170
The current temperature is 26 degrees

13
00:00:39,370 --> 00:00:40,490
sunny weather

14
00:00:40,810 --> 00:00:43,290
There are 19 days left until winter arrives

15
00:00:43,530 --> 00:00:44,530
19 days

16
00:00:44,970 --> 00:00:46,210
What do you think is the best way for us to allocate it?
